<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Deutsche Bank/Commerzbank deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears Deutsche Bank/Commerzbank deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Thursday it had cleared the acquisition by Deutsche Bank and Commerzbank of joint control of J M Voith GmbH as part of the restructuring of the Germany machinery firm.</p>
<p>It said in a statement that the operation would not effect competition as the two banks do not currently hold shares in any company in the same sectors as Voith. The Commission said that the banks intend to resell most of their shares in Voith either directly to private investors or the stock exchange.</p>
</text>
